Oxygen Not Included is developed and published by Klei Entertainment. This project is
not affiliated with or endorsed by Klei Entertainment.

This repository contains no file of the game: no Klei source code, game binaries, game
assets or game data. Building it needs a built copy of oni-sim-replacement, whose ABI
headers are read from that repository and not copied here. Running it on a recorded
corpus needs a corpus recorded from your own game, which is not part of this repository
and must not be redistributed.

No third-party source code is included. The small 5x8 font and the PNG writer are this
project's own. The large font (--font large) is the 7x13 font of the X11 misc-fixed family
(font-misc-misc), which is in the public domain ("Public domain font. Share and enjoy.");
its glyphs are stored as a table in src/font.h. The program links only Windows system
libraries (gdi32, comdlg32, ws2_32) and the mingw-w64 runtime.
